A bara sci-fi visual novel about joining an experiment with big androids. Can you teach a robot the meaning of human love?

Evan is an AI graduate student who dreams of making a new generation of androids capable of eliminating human limitations and suppressing the world's inequality. Living with robots for a while is the opportunity to understand how robots' minds are projected and how they interpret all different types of experiences. But a question circles his mind: is it possible to teach a machine the meaning of human love?

A Sci-fi setting visual novel with BIG ANDROIDS;

NSFW Scenes;

Original Backgrounds;

Gorgeous CGs;

Thematic Sung Song;

Original synthwave soundtrack;

